- LibRaw 0.22.3, Copyright 2008-2025 LibRaw LLC, used under the GNU Lesser General Public
  License version 2.1 (LibRaw is dual licensed LGPL-2.1 / CDDL-1.0; this product chooses LGPL-2.1).
  It reads camera-maker RAW files (CR2/CR3, NEF, ARW, RAF, ORF, RW2, ...).
  * LibRaw is built unmodified as its own shared library, lib/<abi>/libopencamera_libraw.so,
