    LibRaw C API, so you may replace libopencamera_libraw.so with your own build of a
    compatible LibRaw version (same C API) and re-sign the APK.
  * Complete corresponding source: pipeline/third_party/LibRaw in this repository (unmodified
    LibRaw 0.22.3 sources and headers, build list in pipeline/src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt), and
    the upstream release https://www.libraw.org/data/LibRaw-0.22.3.tar.gz
